Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

reTSX as H9 shipped it: the reTS release's tsx_amxx.dll with H9's binary patch that counts
Xash3D's "ID_BOT" bots as bots, 183296 bytes, SHA256
AF2B1D954CB5F37DDBE7F9EBC9BE59C34CC9615C7449B633898F1E88CD9BFB38, kept as tsx_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file.
To go back, copy that over tsx_amxx.dll (its binary patch notes are in git's history of this
file).

Past 32 slots
-------------

This TSX keeps its tables for 128 slots, every loop bounded by the server's maxplayers. With it,
the AMX Mod X core and modules at 128 and every enabled plugin built against MAX_PLAYERS 128,
AMX Mod X as H9 ships it is built for servers past 32 slots.
